sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CMP as Composant Angular
    participant INT as authInterceptor
    participant API as Django / DRF
    participant AUTH as AuthService

    CMP->>INT: GET /api/planning/shifts/
    INT->>API: + Authorization: Bearer (access expiré)
    API-->>INT: 401 Unauthorized

    Note over INT: URL != /token/ et != /api/admin/
    INT->>AUTH: refreshAccessToken()  (single-flight)
    AUTH->>API: POST /api/token/refresh/ (cookie refresh_token)
    API-->>AUTH: 200 { access } (+ rotation : nouveau refresh cookie)
    AUTH-->>INT: nouveau jeton d'accès

    INT->>API: REJOUE GET /api/planning/shifts/ (nouveau Bearer)
    API-->>INT: 200 données
    INT-->>CMP: données

    Note over INT,AUTH: si le refresh échoue -> authService.logout(router.url)<br/>(l'URL courante devient returnUrl)
